# Working memory

Agents update this file. It is the living snapshot of the project.

## Status

- **Status:** active
- **Updated:** 2026-09-25

## Project

- **Name:** Volleyball Manager (`volleyball-manager`)
- **Purpose:** Club platform for admins, coaches, players, and parents — seasons, rosters, live stats, volunteer, calendar, announcements, notes, dues.
- **Audience:** Youth/club volleyball (ADMIN, COACH, PLAYER, PARENT).
- **Stack:** Next.js 14 App Router + Tailwind (`apps/web-client`); NestJS (`apps/api-server`); PostgreSQL + Prisma (`packages/database`); Socket.io; npm workspaces; Docker Compose.
- **Package manager:** npm workspaces (Node 18+)
- **Deploy target:** Local Docker Compose first. Production host unset.

## Current focus

- **Restart handout:** `docs/agent-handoff.md`
- Wave 1 + Wave 2 are implemented and smoked on `cursor/wave2-club-registration-7bd1` (PR https://github.com/icors2/Cursor_Forge/pull/2, draft → `main`). `main` is still the blank starter.
- Wave 1: role-aware nav, Stat Tracking, ICS import, news comments, volunteer cards, roster without dues, season history print, self-serve theme.
- Wave 2: `/admin`; public PARENT/PLAYER register; COACH via one-time hashed invite; create-and-open on `/registrations`; player pool; `/roster` positions.
- Playwright MCP is configured headless in-repo; Cloud still needs dashboard MCP + reload before browser tools appear.
- Demo: sign in → `/home`. LAN: `npm run dev:lan` → `TESTING.md`.
- Not in v1: Stripe, Redis, Storybook, public ADMIN signup, multi-club. Next: Playwright UI walk, merge PR #2, or a named Wave 3 / host.

